    voice "audio/voices/arina/23_en.mp3"
    arina "Yes?"

# game/script.rpy:9644
translate english laborant_2_menu_03ed6bbf:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/270.mp3"
    # Vika "Ты была в моем кабинете? Там наверное все еще хуже?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/270_en.mp3"
    Vika "Were you in my office? It's probably even worse there."

# game/script.rpy:9646
translate english laborant_2_menu_eb860008:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/6.mp3"
    # arina "Да, там конечно нужно прибраться, но не переживай я тебе помогу, тем более он у тебя там ничего не нашел."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/6_en.mp3"
    arina "Yes, there's a lot to clean up, but don't worry, I'll help you. Besides, he didn't find anything there."

# game/script.rpy:9648
translate english laborant_2_menu_99a3c2c5:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/7.mp3"
    # arina "Он сразу ворвался как ворвался в кабинет, устроил там такой беспорядок, что сам в нем потерялся."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/7_en.mp3"
    arina "He barged in like he did in the office, created such a mess that he got lost in it."

# game/script.rpy:9650
translate english laborant_2_menu_abdb604d:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/271.mp3"
    # Vika "Наверное мне не надо помогать с уборкой..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/271_en.mp3"
    Vika "I probably don't need help with cleaning up..."

# game/script.rpy:9652
translate english laborant_2_menu_9c0ef649:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/8.mp3"
    # arina "Ты наврятли там сама справишься, тебе точно нужна помощь, так что не изображай вежливость!"
    voice "audio/voices/arina/8_en.mp3"
    arina "You probably won't be able to handle it alone, you definitely need help, so don't act polite!"

# game/script.rpy:9654
translate english laborant_2_menu_fbaa57b7:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/272.mp3"
    # Vika "Да я не об этом, если все и дальше так же пойдет, то у меня нет кабинета, он его отобрал"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/272_en.mp3"
    Vika "No, I'm not talking about that. If things keep going like this, I won't have an office anymore - he took it from me."

# game/script.rpy:9656
translate english laborant_2_menu_83002e20:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/273.mp3"
    # Vika "Так что пусть там убирается тот, кому достанется этот кабинет."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/273_en.mp3"
    Vika "So let the one who gets this office clean it up there."

# game/script.rpy:9658
translate english laborant_2_menu_dedda37e:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/9.mp3"
    # arina "Это еще кому? На работу никто не устраивается, мы тут работаем в пятером, кому отдавать кабинет?"
    voice "audio/voices/arina/9_en.mp3"
    arina "To whom is it going to be given? No one is being hired for the job, we're just working here in a group of five, to whom should we give the office?"

# game/script.rpy:9660
translate english laborant_2_menu_3f1f7e97:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/274.mp3"
    # Vika "Не знаю..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/274_en.mp3"
    Vika "I don't know..."

# game/script.rpy:9662
translate english laborant_2_menu_126c64b5:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/10.mp3"
    # arina "Так, подожди, а если так дальше не пойдет?"
    voice "audio/voices/arina/10_en.mp3"
    arina "Wait, what if it doesn't go on like this?"

# game/script.rpy:9664
translate english laborant_2_menu_47e052c2:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/275.mp3"
    # Vika "Ну тогда... Я уезжаю в питер..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/275_en.mp3"
    Vika "Then... I'm leaving for St. Petersburg..."

# game/script.rpy:9666
translate english laborant_2_menu_f7281172:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/11.mp3"
    # arina "Так это правда, что толстяк про тебя говорил???"
    voice "audio/voices/arina/11_en.mp3"
    arina "Is it true that the fat guy was talking about you???"

# game/script.rpy:9668
translate english laborant_2_menu_d23f9045:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/276.mp3"
    # Vika "Нет, из всего того бреда только питер правда, честно."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/276_en.mp3"
    Vika "No, only St. Petersburg is true among all that nonsense, honestly."

# game/script.rpy:9670
translate english laborant_2_menu_35296755:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/12.mp3"
    # arina "А чего это тебя туда понесло?"
    voice "audio/voices/arina/12_en.mp3"
    arina "What made you want to go there?"

# game/script.rpy:9672
translate english laborant_2_menu_913c6083:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/277.mp3"
    # Vika "Да задолбалась я в этом уренгое, каждый день что-то не так, муж в айти, ему все равно где жить, а я не хочу здесь больше оставаться."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/277_en.mp3"
    Vika "Yes, I'm tired of this place. Every day something goes wrong. My husband works in IT, he doesn't care where to live, but I don't want to stay here anymore."

# game/script.rpy:9674
translate english laborant_2_menu_eb9ca091:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/13.mp3"
    # arina "Ясно. В общем кидаешь меня."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/13_en.mp3"
    arina "I see. So you're just going to leave me behind."

# game/script.rpy:9676
translate english laborant_2_menu_0d965d4e:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/278.mp3"
    # Vika "Ну частично, я буду писать..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/278_en.mp3"
    Vika "Well, partially, I'll be writing..."

# game/script.rpy:9678
translate english laborant_2_menu_18e3d883:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/14.mp3"
    # arina "Да ладно тебе, не бери в голову я единственная тут кто желает тебе счастья, так что живи спокойно."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/14_en.mp3"
    arina "Yes, I know, but don't worry, I'll be here for you. So live peacefully."

# game/script.rpy:9685
translate english laborant_2_menu_bca72b3e:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/279.mp3"
    # Vika "Ты случайно не знаешь, что за такой особый напиток пьет наш босс?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/279_en.mp3"
    Vika "Do you happen to know what special drink our boss drinks?"

# game/script.rpy:9687
translate english laborant_2_menu_c74a3bdb:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/15.mp3"
    # arina "Толи чай то ли кофе, не знаю, но могу сказать, что он постоянно таскает у меня сахар."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/15_en.mp3"
    arina "Either tea or coffee, I don't know, but I can say that he constantly takes sugar from me."

# game/script.rpy:9689
translate english laborant_2_menu_d09035df:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/280.mp3"
    # Vika "А можно я у тебя его тоже возьму?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/280_en.mp3"
    Vika "Is it okay if I take some from you too?"

# game/script.rpy:9691
translate english laborant_2_menu_e8c41db9:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/16.mp3"
    # arina "Мы же с тобой его вместе покупали, зачем ты спрашиваешь? Только есть одно но..."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/16_en.mp3"
    arina "We did buy it together, so why are you asking? But there's one thing..."

# game/script.rpy:9693
translate english laborant_2_menu_e2f68d09:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/281.mp3"
    # Vika "Какое?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/281_en.mp3"
    Vika "What is it?"

# game/script.rpy:9695
translate english laborant_2_menu_cacc73fe:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/17.mp3"
    # arina "Когда босс тут все переворачивал, надписи с коробок послетали, теперь я не знаю где реагент, а где сахар."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/17_en.mp3"
    arina "When the boss was flipping everything over here, the labels on the boxes came off, now I don't know where the reagent is and where the sugar is."

# game/script.rpy:9697
translate english laborant_2_menu_3a9c494f:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/18.mp3"
    # arina "Если угадаешь где из шести коробок сахар, то бери конечно, если не угадаешь, тоже бери."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/18_en.mp3"
    arina "If you guess which of the six boxes has sugar, then of course take it, if you don't guess, take it anyway."

# game/script.rpy:9699
translate english laborant_2_menu_49bd014c:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/282.mp3"
    # Vika "Добавить реагент в чай?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/282_en.mp3"
    Vika "Should I add the reagent to the tea?"

# game/script.rpy:9701
translate english laborant_2_menu_02f365f5:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/19.mp3"
    # arina "Ну он не умрет конечно, но в туалет сбегать может, хотя с его весом я думаю, что ему для эффекта всю коробку надо съесть."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/19_en.mp3"
    arina "Well, he won't die of course, but he might have to run to the bathroom, although with his weight, I think he would have to eat the whole box for the effect."

# game/script.rpy:9703
translate english laborant_2_menu_ca5abbd2:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/283.mp3"
    # Vika "А они прям вообще не отличаются?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/283_en.mp3"
    Vika "Are they really that similar?"

# game/script.rpy:9705
translate english laborant_2_menu_cc50d058:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/20.mp3"
    # arina "На вид ничем, только весом, реагент весит 2 грамма, а сахар - 3"
    voice "audio/voices/arina/20_en.mp3"
    arina "They look the same, only by weight, the reagent weighs 2 grams, and the sugar - 3"

# game/script.rpy:9707
translate english laborant_2_menu_7e9e666e:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/21.mp3"
    # arina "Там конечно есть весы, но после погрома не думаю, что они взвесят что-то больше одного раза, но можешь попробовать."
    voice "audio/voices/arina/21_en.mp3"
    arina "There are scales there, but after the mess, I don't think they'll weigh something more than once, but you can try."

# game/script.rpy:9709
translate english laborant_2_menu_a8a568cd:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/284.mp3"
    # Vika "Спасибо"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/284_en.mp3"
    Vika "Thank you"

# game/script.rpy:9718
translate english laborant_2_menu_48a7b205:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/need_go.mp3"
    # Vika "Мне пора идти"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/need_go_en.mp3"
    Vika "I need to go."

# game/script.rpy:9720
translate english laborant_2_menu_ec3a514d:

    # voice "audio/voices/arina/22.mp3"
    # arina "Заглядывай!"
    voice "audio/voices/arina/22_en.mp3"
    arina "Come on in!"

# game/script.rpy:9811
translate english ves_934e71a1:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/285.mp3"
    # Vika "Хммм и в какой же коробке сахар..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/285_en.mp3"
    Vika "Hmm, and in which box is the sugar..."

# game/script.rpy:9841
translate english dostatochno_087e1bbe:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/286.mp3"
    # Vika "уже слишком много кубиков, мне хватит одного"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/286_en.mp3"
    Vika "Too many cubes already, one is enough for me"

# game/script.rpy:9903
translate english win_sugar_270af707:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/287.mp3"
    # Vika "Да, это 100%% сахар"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/287_en.mp3"
    Vika "Yes, this is 100% sugar"

# game/script.rpy:9919
translate english lose_sugar_dbbc5330:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/288.mp3"
    # Vika "Нет, похоже что это не сахар"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/288_en.mp3"
    Vika "No, it looks like this isn't sugar"

# game/script.rpy:10119
translate english edik_room1_28f9a8be:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/289.mp3"
    # Vika "Надеюсь что это то что нужно"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/289_en.mp3"
    Vika "I hope this is what we need"

# game/script.rpy:10148
translate english zaperto_057dd9af:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/290.mp3"
    # Vika "Заперто"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/290_en.mp3"
    Vika "Locked"

# game/script.rpy:10188
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_55ecd842:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/1.mp3"
    # edik "Да где же он..."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/1_en.mp3"
    edik "Where is he..."

# game/script.rpy:10190
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_22fa586f:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/291.mp3"
    # Vika "Эдик???"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/291_en.mp3"
    Vika "Edik???"

# game/script.rpy:10192
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_903ca815:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/2.mp3"
    # edik "Вика??? Что ты тут делаешь?"
    voice "audio/voices/edik/2_en.mp3"
    edik "Vika??? What are you doing here?"

# game/script.rpy:10194
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_08e05c6a:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/292.mp3"
    # Vika "А ты что тут делаешь?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/292_en.mp3"
    Vika "What are you doing here?"

# game/script.rpy:10196
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_d014183d:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/3.mp3"
    # edik "Я? эммм..."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/3_en.mp3"
    edik "Me? ummm..."

# game/script.rpy:10198
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_61e8d4b8:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/293.mp3"
    # Vika "То есть я пол дня слушаю какая я плохая, как я у тебя проекты ворую!!! А ты стоишь тут возле их входа и даже не можешь внятно ответить что ты тут делаешь???"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/293_en.mp3"
    Vika "So I've been listening all day to how bad I am, how I steal your projects!!! And you're standing here by their entrance and can't even give a clear answer about what you're doing here???"

# game/script.rpy:10200
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_f6b361a7:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/4.mp3"
    # edik "Я никогда не говорил что ты воруешь у меня проекты."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/4_en.mp3"
    edik "I never said that you steal projects from me."

# game/script.rpy:10202
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_9f2d487f:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/294.mp3"
    # Vika "Я знаю что ты не говорил, этот придурок сам себе напридумывал все это!!!"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/294_en.mp3"
    Vika "I know you didn't say that, this idiot made it all up himself!!!"

# game/script.rpy:10204
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_0c115bd1:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/5.mp3"
    # edik "Тихо, я воровал эти проекты, только не ори так."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/5_en.mp3"
    edik "Quiet, I stole these projects, just don't shout like that."

# game/script.rpy:10206
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_5db9d722:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/295.mp3"
    # Vika "Ты воровал проекты??? У себя? Что ты несешь?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/295_en.mp3"
    Vika "You stole the projects??? From yourself? What are you talking about?"

# game/script.rpy:10208
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_23907bd1:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/6.mp3"
    # edik "Да не у себя, а отсюда... У меня тут девушка работает..."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/6_en.mp3"
    edik "No, not from myself, but from here... I have a girlfriend working here..."

# game/script.rpy:10210
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_60ef4bd2:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/296.mp3"
    # Vika "Ага, а чего ты тогда здесь трешься а не к ней идешь..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/296_en.mp3"
    Vika "Yeah, but why are you here instead of going to her?"

# game/script.rpy:10212
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_fe1519ec:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/7.mp3"
    # edik "Потому что я ходил сюда по ее пропуску, а сейчас он куда-то делся, я его вчера в карман джинс клал..."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/7_en.mp3"
    edik "Because I came here with her pass, and now it's somewhere, I put it in the pocket of my jeans yesterday..."

# game/script.rpy:10214
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_b90d7b36:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/297.mp3"
    # Vika "Я правильно понимаю что ты воровал проекты в эмергене, но ты на столько никчемный, что не смог выпустить их быстрее?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/297_en.mp3"
    Vika "Am I right in understanding that you stole projects in Emergen, but you're so worthless that you couldn't release them faster?"

# game/script.rpy:10216
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_5bfe5a86:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/8.mp3"
    # edik "Да, да, все так, только не ори пожалуйста"
    voice "audio/voices/edik/8_en.mp3"
    edik "Yes, yes, that's right, just please don't shout"

# game/script.rpy:10218
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_626721df:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/298.mp3"
    # Vika "И ты деже не знаешь где потерял свой пропуск?"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/298_en.mp3"
    Vika "Don't you even know where you lost your pass?"

# game/script.rpy:10220
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_a920b622:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/9.mp3"
    # edik "Да, я клал его в карман джинсов на работе, если я его там и выронил - это очень плохо..."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/9_en.mp3"
    edik "Yes, I put it in the pocket of my jeans at work, if I lost it there - that's very bad..."

# game/script.rpy:10222
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_8c331a02:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/299.mp3"
    # Vika "Так ты его там и выронил, его босс уже нашел и теперь обвиняет меня в том что я не делала"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/299_en.mp3"
    Vika "So you lost it there, and your boss already found it and now blames me for not doing anything?"

# game/script.rpy:10224
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_68e3f3e6:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/10.mp3"
    # edik "Все, это конец, у него есть ключи от моего кабинета, если он зайдет в туда, он все найдет..."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/10_en.mp3"
    edik "That's it, it's over, he has the keys to my office, if he goes in there, he'll find everything..."

# game/script.rpy:10226
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_96e24831:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/300.mp3"
    # Vika "Не бойся, не зайдет, он слишком сильно уверен в том что он прав. Пока..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/300_en.mp3"
    Vika "Don't worry, he won't go in there, he's too confident that he's right. For now..."

# game/script.rpy:10228
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_d251f46c:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/11.mp3"
    # edik "Но ты же меня не сдашь?"
    voice "audio/voices/edik/11_en.mp3"
    edik "But you won't turn me in, will you?"

# game/script.rpy:10230
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_b7c5afcf:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/301.mp3"
    # Vika "Я бы сдала, но для меня же это все равно ничего не решит, я придумаю что-нибудь другое..."
    voice "audio/voices/vika/301_en.mp3"
    Vika "I would turn you in, but for me, it wouldn't change anything. I'll think of something else..."

# game/script.rpy:10232
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_81fdc3b9:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/12.mp3"
    # edik "Ну хоть так, тогда просто скажи, что я заболел..."
    voice "audio/voices/edik/12_en.mp3"
    edik "Well, at least that, then just say that I'm sick..."

# game/script.rpy:10234
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_bc2be800:

    # voice "audio/voices/vika/302.mp3"
    # Vika "Какой чай он пьет?! Ты точно знаешь!"
    voice "audio/voices/vika/302_en.mp3"
    Vika "What kind of tea does he drink?! You definitely know!"

# game/script.rpy:10236
translate english emeregen_vhod_with_edik_051166ce:

    # voice "audio/voices/edik/13.mp3"
    # edik "Черный, черный, только прикрой меня!"
